      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T20:00:33Z",
      "body": "Review requested — independent, non-author, at exact head `96cd508a` (all feature content is the author lab's from #1548; the deltas here are the main merge, three conflict resolutions, and four `StackConfig` fixture fields). Evidence is already at this head: `cargo fmt --check` PASS, claim-wording PASS, `cargo check --workspace --all-targets` PASS, `cargo test --workspace --lib` 1098/4/60 with only the known pre-existing Adam-threshold failures (#1546). One APPROVE at this head satisfies the merge rule; I will drive the protected merge once it lands.",
