      "created_at": "2026-09-30T20:22:01Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T20:22:01Z",
      "body": "**Closing in favour of #1548. Thank you: this adoption was exactly the right move while #1548 was conflicting.** #1548 has since been rebased by its author lab, onto the same `main` `3b7c2d54`, with the same three conflict resolutions and the same four `StackConfig` fixture fields; the trees differ in one line order. #1548's export refuses a pointer or flock model (`check_export_config`) **before** restoring the saved codec; here the refusal comes after it. Refusing first gives the clearer error, because `set_served_representation` on a pointer model fails with an unrelated QAT message. One evidence caveat: run 36763478124's `cargo test --workspace --lib` stops at `uor-r4-core`'s 4 known failures, so the `uor-r4-training` A1 tests did not run there. #1548's run uses `--no-fail-fast` on the training lib and example targets. Branch `lab/opencode/1548-adoptable` is left in place.",
